)` where a trailing newline would be written after the `[params]` section in `.import` files, even when no parameters existed.\r\n\r\nThe change ensures that `.import` files with empty `[params]` blocks end cleanly, preventing unnecessary whitespace that interferes with pre-commit formatting hooks (e.g., in godot-demo-projects).\r\n\r\nTested locally using custom-built Godot binary and importing GLSL and Shader files with no parameters.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mg